  "t1": {
   "x": 0,
   "y": -320,
   "text": "Trading journal concept: drop the charts, talk it through, learn weekly",
   "kind": "title1",
   "maxW": 16640
  },
  "s1": {
   "x": -480,
   "y": 0,
   "w": 380,
   "text": "Sample data throughout: one set of 134 entries going back a year, so every screen's numbers agree. Swap in yours.\n\nEvery frame works. Press Play and click anything: filters, menus, the voice note, tags, charts, the account picker.\n\nCharts are the record. Everything else (tags, numbers, patterns) exists to help you read them.\n\nDashboard (home): what happened, in R and %, never money.\n\nTrade log: everything you record, any time, newest first, as a list or a grid. One chart story at a time: drop its charts, talk it through, and your note fills what you haven't set.\n\nWeekly review: one page per week, built from what you recorded, and one thing to do differently.",
   "fill": "gray",
   "size": "m"
  },
  "t2": {
   "x": 0,
   "y": 2190,
   "text": "Accounts and settings",
   "kind": "title1",
   "maxW": 6000
  }
